      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F006C006B0073002000630061006C006C0020006D00650020004C00610064007900200043006C006500610072002E00200048006100700070007900200074006F0020006200650020006F006600200073006500720076006900630065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve got a knack for giving Pokémon a fresh start\nby clearing away the base points they’ve built up.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nWiping the slate clean, if you get me.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
