      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006C006C0020006D00650020006D006F007200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can give a Pokémon a clean slate, clearing away\nall the base points they’ve worked to build up.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you want me to clear away any pesky history,\nbring me <U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002>, Mega Shard<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0002>Ās and say the word.",
